  "seg": 0
 },
 {
  "text": "the road disappears.",
  "start": 3.22,
  "end": 4.44,
  "seg": 0
 },
 {
  "text": "Alaska lists Ryan Air for a",
  "start": 5.48,
  "end": 8.49,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "projected preliminary award of",
  "start": 8.52,
  "end": 10.97,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "four million one hundred seventy",
  "start": 11.0,
  "end": 11.450000000000001,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "one thousand one hundred fifteen",
  "start": 11.48,
  "end": 15.68,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "dollars.",
  "start": 16.9,
  "end": 17.256999999999998,
  "seg": 1
 },
 {
  "text": "Ryan Air proposes autonomous cargo",
  "start": 17.287,
  "end": 19.97,
  "seg": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "drones and electric vertical takeoff",
  "start": 20.0,
  "end": 22.77,
  "seg": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "and landing aircraft.",
  "start": 22.8,
  "end": 24.02,
  "seg": 2
 },
 {
  "text": "Cargo could carry medicine.",
  "start": 24.98,
  "end": 26.61,
  "seg": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "Electric aircraft are proposed",
  "start": 26.64,
  "end": 29.049999999999997,
  "seg": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "for patients and providers.",
  "start": 29.08,
  "end": 30.74,
  "seg": 3
 },
 {
  "text": "Those are not the same test.",
  "start": 31.7,
  "end": 33.98,
  "seg": 4
 },
 {
  "text": "Ryan Air says it serves more",
  "start": 35.04,
  "end": 37.05,
  "seg": 5
 },
 {
  "text": "than seventy villages, so the test",
  "start": 37.08,
  "end": 39.57,
  "seg": 5
 },
 {
  "text": "would extend an aviation network.",
  "start": 39.6,
  "end": 41.6,
  "seg": 5
 },
 {
  "text": "First comes one medicine box.",
  "start": 42.64,
  "end": 44.34,
  "seg": 6
 },
 {
  "text": "Can an authorized route deliver",
  "start": 46.76,
  "end": 48.41,
  "seg": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "it on time inside Alaska weather?",
  "start": 48.44,
  "end": 50.58,
  "seg": 7
 },
 {
  "text": "The notice documents no aircraft",
  "start": 51.78,
  "end": 55.43,
  "seg": 8
 },
 {
  "text": "purchase, F A A approval, route",
  "start": 55.46,
  "end": 58.38,
  "seg": 8
 },
 {
  "text": "or completed flight.",
  "start": 58.86,
  "end": 59.82,
  "seg": 8
 },
 {
  "text": "The map is unsettled.",
  "start": 60.94,
  "end": 62.62,
  "seg": 9
 },
 {
  "text": "The summary names Bethel and Dillingham.",
  "start": 63.54,
  "end": 66.08,
  "seg": 10
 },
 {
  "text": "A separate field lists Anchorage,",
  "start": 67.04,
  "end": 69.16,
  "seg": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "Bristol Bay, Dillingham and Yukon",
  "start": 69.6,
  "end": 72.25,
  "seg": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "Koyukuk.",
  "start": 72.28,
  "end": 72.98,
  "seg": 11
 },
 {
  "text": "Then the second ladder gets steeper.",
  "start": 73.66,
  "end": 76.1,
  "seg": 12
 },
 {
  "text": "The official source calls only",
  "start": 76.94,
  "end": 79.09,
  "seg": 13
 },
 {
  "text": "the cargo drones autonomous.",
  "start": 79.12,
  "end": 80.65,
  "seg": 13
 },
 {
  "text": "Passenger electric aircraft need",
  "start": 80.68,
  "end": 83.75,
  "seg": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "their own aircraft, pilot and operating",
  "start": 83.78,
  "end": 86.51,
  "seg": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "approvals.",
  "start": 86.54,
  "end": 87.24000000000001,
  "seg": 14
 },
 {
  "text": "Budget finalization is in progress,",
  "start": 88.12,
  "end": 90.34,
  "seg": 15
 },
 {
  "text": "and projected amounts may change.",
  "start": 90.82,
  "end": 92.76,
  "seg": 15
 },
 {
  "text": "Still, this award matters because",
  "start": 93.72,
  "end": 96.23,
  "seg": 16
 },
 {
  "text": "the proposal describes gaps in",
  "start": 96.26,
  "end": 98.45,
  "seg": 16
 },
 {
  "text": "medicine access and transport.",
  "start": 98.48,
  "end": 100.28,
  "seg": 16
 },
 {
  "text": "A first test needs a named",
  "start": 101.32,
  "end": 103.07,
  "seg": 17
 },
 {
  "text": "route, F A A certification and",
  "start": 103.1,
  "end": 105.41,
  "seg": 17
 },
 {
  "text": "operating authorization.",
  "start": 105.44,
  "end": 106.4,
  "seg": 17
 },
 {
  "text": "The proposal matters when medicine",
  "start": 111.38,
  "end": 113.11,
  "seg": 18
 },
 {
  "text": "moves on that authorized route.",
  "start": 113.14,
  "end": 114.56,
  "seg": 18
 },
 {
  "text": "Until that box lands, the future",
  "start": 115.9,
  "end": 118.31,
